{
 "duration": 24.852,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Sam finished his November hike warm and happy.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.871
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he stood by the car in his sweaty shirt, packing up.",
   "start": 3.221,
   "end": 6.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Within minutes he was shivering.",
   "start": 6.35,
   "end": 7.86
  },
  {
   "text": "A wet layer pulls heat from you fast once you stop moving.",
   "start": 8.26,
   "end": 11.498
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Leave a dry shirt and a warm fleece in the car.",
   "start": 12.048,
   "end": 15.708
  },
  {
   "text": "Change your wet top first,",
   "start": 16.108,
   "end": 17.513
  },
  {
   "text": "then zip up the fleece before you do anything else.",
   "start": 17.713,
   "end": 20.218
  },
  {
   "text": "Sam drove home warm.",
   "start": 20.768,
   "end": 22.071
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 22.621,
   "end": 24.652
  }
 ],
